Patches applied to the pristine nvme-cli-2.16 tarball by ../unpack.sh.

They apply with `patch -p1` from inside src/, in filename order.  Each one
starts with a few lines of prose saying what it does and why, then the diff.

  0001-alloc-huge-without-hugetlb.patch
        Large buffers skip the MAP_HUGETLB attempt (no HugeTLB pool) and
        come from the posix_memalign() fallback.

  0002-rpmb-digests-in-process.patch
        The RPMB HMAC-SHA256 and MD5 digests are computed by
        ../likeos-hash.c instead of the kernel crypto socket (AF_ALG).

